# Force LF line endings for anything a POSIX shell / node interpreter
# must read. Windows checkouts of these files must still have LF; otherwise
# bash on macOS/Linux errors with:
#   /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
# and node's shebang parsing chokes similarly on CRLF endings.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
